.803,30.938 564.346,32.338 C564.756,33.391 565.244,34.978 565.378,37.899 C565.522,41.056 565.552,42.003 565.552,50 C565.552,57.996 565.522,58.943 565.378,62.101 M570.82,37.631 C570.674,34.438 570.167,32.258 569.425,30.349 C568.659,28.377 567.633,26.702 565.965,25.035 C564.297,23.368 562.623,22.342 560.652,21.575 C558.743,20.834 556.562,20.326 553.369,20.18 C550.169,20.033 549.148,20 541,20 C532.853,20 531.831,20.033 528.631,20.18 C525.438,20.326 523.257,20.834 521.349,21.575 C519.376,22.342 517.703,23.368 516.035,25.035 C514.368,26.702 513.342,28.377 512.574,30.349 C511.834,32.258 511.326,34.438 511.181,37.631 C511.035,40.831 511,41.851 511,50 C511,58.147 511.035,59.17 511.181,62.369 C511.326,65.562 511.834,67.743 512.574,69.651 C513.342,71.625 514.368,73.296 516.035,74.965 C517.703,76.634 519.376,77.658 521.349,78.425 C523.257,79.167 525.438,79.673 528.631,79.82 C531.831,79.965 532.853,80.001 541,80.001 C549.148,80.001 550.169,79.965 553.369,79.82 C556.562,79.673 558.743,79.167 560.652,78.425 C562.623,77.658 564.297,76.634 565.965,74.965 C567.633,73.296 568.659,71.625 569.425,69.651 C570.167,67.743 570.674,65.562 570.82,62.369 C570.966,59.17 571,58.147 571,50 C571,41.851 570.966,40.831 570.82,37.631\"></path></g></g></g></svg></div>\n<div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\">\n<div style=\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p></a></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"//platform.instagram.com/en_US/embeds.js\"></script></p>\n<p>地域の春の風物詩として親しまれているこのお祭り。特ににぎわいを見せそうなのが、19日（火）・20日（水）に登場する<strong>約60店の露店！</strong> 時間は午前10時〜午後8時までとなっており、境内が縁日ムードに包まれます。</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_23215\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-23215\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23215\" src=\"https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-9.jpg\" alt=\"新琴似神社\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-9.jpg 1280w, https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-9-768x576.jpg 768w, https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-9-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-23215\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※過去の様子</p></div>\n<p>また、20日（水）には神輿渡御も実施予定。午後4時からは、新琴似小学校ミニ児童会館による奉納演舞も予定されています（雨天中止）。</p>\n<p>御朱印集めがお好きな方は、期間限定の御朱印にも注目ですね。</p>\n<div class=\"alert alert-block\">・例祭限定御朱印（500円）<br />\n・春の大祭切り絵御朱印（1200円）</div>\n<p>花手水も実施予定とのことで、いつもより華やかな境内の雰囲気を楽しめそうです…！</p>\n<div id=\"attachment_23216\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-23216\" class=\"size-full wp-image-23216\" src=\"https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-6.jpg\" alt=\"新琴似神社\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-6.jpg 1280w, https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-6-768x576.jpg 768w, https://sapporokitaku.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/193/2022/07/shinkotoni-6-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-23216\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">※写真は過去開催時のもの</p></div>\n<p>なお、期間中は露店設営のため境内駐車場は利用不可。公共交通機関を利用するようにしましょう。春のおでかけ先として、足を運んでみてはいかが？</p>\n"
  }
